    "sub_name": "視覺感測及辨識系統",
    "sub_ename": "VISION SENSOR AND RECOGNITION SYSTEM",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要為實作導向，將介?視覺感測之算法及機器學習在智慧辨識的應用，提升人機之間的互動與學習。課程?容包含(1)圖像處理技術的介紹及實踐:(2)機器學習算法:(3)物件偵測及語義分割。",
    "describe_eh": "This course mainly focuses on project-based learning. It introduces the application of vision intelligent and machine learning for robot to see and interact with the world. The contents include the introduction and practice of (I) image processing techniques; (2) machine learning algorithm; (3) object recognition and segmentation.",
